        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stanley  4\" x 4\" Raised Barrel Stainless Steel Hinge with Plain Bearings</b>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSpecial type <b>Raised Barrel Hinge</b>: The hinge pin and knuckle is moved away from the door frame via its bent hinge leaves. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade rust resistant, stainless steel pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Stanley 4 x 4 Raised Barrel Stainless Steel Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.129\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Raised Barrel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>* These hinges are normally special order 5-6 weeks to ship. \r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually (1 door hinge)</i>\r\n</p>",
